  "description": "Strongly-typed, validated environment variables for .NET. Declare env vars as typed properties with [EnvVar] attributes, register with AddEnvGuard<T>(), and get fail-fast startup validation. All missing or malformed variables reported at once. Supports string, int, bool, double, enum, Uri, TimeSpan, and nullable types. Zero external dependencies.",
